WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.415 --> 00:00:02.999
Unit fourteen. Cyberbullying!

2
00:00:03.951 --> 00:00:07.227
Hello, everyone! I'm Doctor Visal, your school doctor.

3
00:00:07.277 --> 00:00:10.514
Hi, Doctor Visal! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:10.564 --> 00:00:13.702
Today we learn about Cyberbullying. Let's go!

5
00:00:14.682 --> 00:00:18.599
Cyberbullying. Say it with me. Cyberbullying!

6
00:00:22.144 --> 00:00:25.961
Harassment. Say it with me. Harassment!

7
00:00:29.465 --> 00:00:33.232
Screenshot. Say it with me. Screenshot!

8
00:00:36.702 --> 00:00:39.452
Block. Say it with me. Block!

9
00:00:42.920 --> 00:00:46.154
Report. Say it with me. Report!

10
00:00:49.660 --> 00:00:53.094
Upstander. Say it with me. Upstander!

11
00:00:56.574 --> 00:01:00.274
Trusted adult. Say it with me. Trusted adult!

12
00:01:03.774 --> 00:01:07.208
Support. Say it with me. Support!

13
00:01:10.745 --> 00:01:19.680
Cyberbullying is harassment using phones or the internet. Take a screenshot, block, and report it. Be an upstander and tell a trusted adult so the person gets support.

14
00:01:19.730 --> 00:01:22.432
Now I understand. Thank you, Doctor Visal!

15
00:01:23.890 --> 00:01:28.840
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:28.890 --> 00:01:30.040
Screenshot!

17
00:01:31.045 --> 00:01:35.996
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:36.046 --> 00:01:37.232
Trusted adult!

19
00:01:38.379 --> 00:01:42.733
Did you know? Most social media apps have a way to report bullying directly!

20
00:01:42.783 --> 00:01:44.772
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:46.157 --> 00:01:53.839
Think and answer. How can you support someone being cyberbullied?

22
00:01:53.889 --> 00:01:55.039
Great answer!

23
00:01:56.108 --> 00:02:00.647
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:00.697 --> 00:02:03.243
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

